Ray.ImageKernelConvolution: ptr<Image> image ptr<f32> kernel int kernelSize;    # Apply custom square convolution kernel to image
Ray.ImageResize: ptr<Image> image int newWidth int newHeight;    # Resize image (Bicubic scaling algorithm)
